  "reasons_not_admitted": [
    "Train/validation are disjoint by recording session, but the release metadata does not expose instructor/performer identity; participant-independent validation cannot be established.",
    "The exact 160-train/207-validation pitch-shifted plan totals 36,117,365,135 bytes; the 2026-10-18T23:47:50Z progress snapshot reached 152/367 files (15,618,036,223 bytes), with 8 partial files totaling 578,813,952 bytes. The executable partial journal audit found zero selection/ETag/size/offset/path errors without recomputing media hashes; full-media integrity and window extraction remain pending.",
    "One selected training-session AV file passes stream/timing checks; separate encoder smokes show finite outputs but do not measure HoloAssist task quality.",
    "Hash-bound feature packing and matched 2,048-step readout tooling are implemented but have not been run on HoloAssist features.",
    "Wrong/not-corrected validation support is only 11 intervals, so the five-way label must not be treated as a balanced or well-powered evaluation task.",
    "Five reversed fine-action intervals were found in train/validation metadata; a future adapter must exclude them deterministically and report counts."
